ShowtimeSeats ||--o| OrderSeats : "ShowtimeSeatId → Id"
Orders ||--o{ OrderComboFoods : "OrderId → Id"
ComboFoods ||--o{ OrderComboFoods : "ComboFoodId → Id"
Cinemas |o..o{ ComboFoods : "CinemaId → Id"
Orders ||--o| Invoices : "OrderId → Id"
Invoices |o..o{ Invoices : "OriginalInvoiceId → Id (tự tham chiếu)"
Orders ||--o| RefundTransactions : "OrderId → Id (UNIQUE, tối đa 1 lần hoàn/đơn)"
